,{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-08-05T12:57:04Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T15:07:15Z","closed_at":"2026-09-21T15:07:11Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122128","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122128","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122128.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122128.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-21T15:07:11Z"},"body":"- Partially supersedes #118010\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nEver since #116562, we've been utilizing the legacy Ruff linter ruleset instead of the [new default rules](https://docs.astral.sh/ruff/default-rules/). The intent was to gradually adopt the new defaults, fine-tuning the rules to only utilize what we want. This aims to add one such section, integrating one of the larger new rulesets: [`pyupgrade`](https://docs.astral.sh/ruff/rules/#pyupgrade-up).\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nWe were already using 3 rules from this section since #99640, so some busywork has already been accounted for. The overwhelming majority of changes from the full ruleset had to do with modernizing our fstring usage or otherwise substituting `%` with `.format()`.\r\n\r\nThe only `pyupgrade` rule that's explicitly excluded is [`UP015`](https://docs.astral.sh/ruff/rules/redundant-open-modes/), which would flag and remove redundant file opening arguments. This was previously brought up as too opinionated for our tastes, and is actually not included in Ruff's new default ruleset, so we're not going against the grain by removing it.\r\n\r\nAs this ruleset rollout will be applied gradually, we don't have to be as conservative with what kind of rules are flagged for auto-fixing. As such, `extend-safe-fixes` has been changed to `ALL`.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122128/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122128/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}